# Vercel only needs the web app + shared/ (addresses, ABI) + workspace config.
# Exclude everything sensitive or heavy from the upload.

# Secrets — NEVER upload local env files (these hold private keys).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env*.example

# Heavy / irrelevant to the web build
.git
**/node_modules
# Anchored to repo root so it excludes ONLY the reference-clones dir, NOT the
# product's docs route (web/app/docs) — an unanchored "docs" 404s that page.
/docs
target
**/target
.next
**/.next
**/coverage
agent/.data
agent/logs
*.log

# Local scratch / non-app dirs
PRD
TDD
buildathon
arb_dex.json
arb_fees.json
arb_tvl.json
research.md
